  "retainedHarnessCorrections": [
    "Archive contains servoshell rather than the older documented servo filename; help/version inspection followed discovery.",
    "Initial SVGOMG UI check could pass before worker output or frame content was verified. It is retained only as a UI observation.",
    "Early SVG checks used parent document access and assumed the anchor download attribute held the eventual filename; neither proves native frame or download behavior. Those attempts are not accepted as a browser failure diagnosis.",
    "Revised check uses native WebDriver frame switching and five seconds of polling, then records readyState, MIME type and actual document root.",
    "The first Chromium control selected installed version 156.0.8078.4. It remains separate; a subsequent control asserts the pinned 148.0.7778.96 version before and after launch and passes."
  ],
  "decision": "Do not implement a full adapter or time this published Servo build as a drop-in candidate. It lacks the tested SVG document DOM behavior and fresh-context semantics. Reconsider only with a concrete implementation that resolves those boundaries; matching optimized bytes alone is insufficient.",
  "limits": [
    "This rejects the selected stock-engine route at its functional gate, not every possible future/custom Servo embedder.",
    "No complete SVG conformance, full browser isolation, full runner adapter, downloads or performance claims.",
    "Fresh processes could supply isolation but their complete cost has not been compared.",
    "No application fixtures or ordinary Flashwright behavior were changed."
  ],
